<headline>FINAL PRICING - Monmouth Cty Imp Auth, N.J..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>William E. Simon &amp; Sons Municipal Securities Inc. said it received the verbal award for the $19.760 million of Monmouth County Improvement Authority, N.J. revenue (Howell Township Board of Education Project) bonds, Series 1997 with a top yield of 5.80 percent in 2017.</p>
